      ('Aditi S.', 'Andheri', 'Gel Manicure', 'Spotless hygiene, gorgeous studio and a manicure that genuinely lasted three weeks.', 5, 3),
      ('Kavya R.', 'Powai', 'Bridal Trial', 'The trial took away all my wedding-day nerves. Ananya explained every step and adjusted until it felt like me.', 5, 4);
